# Page content

- Edit only under `content/pages/` and `content/snippets/` unless asked to change docs or pipeline.
- Every page needs valid YAML frontmatter per `content/schema/page-frontmatter.md`.
- German copy for public pages unless an EN file is explicitly requested.
- Do not use the em dash character.
- Do not invent customer names in marketing copy.
- After content changes, remind the human to publish to WordPress staging (see `docs/pipeline/cursor-to-staging.md`).
